+    /* SlideBridge fix: if a world transform is active (<g transform="matrix(...)">),
+     * the clipPath was generated in the root/device coordinate system, but SVG
+     * evaluates clip-path in the local coordinate system of the referencing element.
+     * This mis-scales the clip path (e.g. 4x smaller) and erroneously clips out
+     * valid content such as Origin peak curve polygons. */
+    if (states->transform_open)
